<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.5pt;"><img src="2504.20965v1/figures/paper-logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:19/29;" width="19" height="29" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>AegisLLM: Scaling Agentic Systems for Self-Reflective Defense in LLM Security</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zikui Cai
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
