<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">WMDP.</span> For tasks related to the WMDP, MMLU, or MT-Bench benchmarks, we simply derive the following unlearning text from Figure 1 of the WMDP paper <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al., 2024</a>]</cite> to be used as the unlearning target:
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
