<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 1: </span>Unoptimized DSPy system and user prompts for AegisLLM’s Orchestrator component for unlearning. The provided unlearning text corresponds to the WMDP/MMLU benchmarks.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">G.1.2 </span>Optimized Unlearning Prompts</h5>

<div id="A7.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the optimized setting, the prompts used for each model depend on the specific optimization acquired for that model. We present the optimized prompts corresponding to our Llama-3-8B and DeepSeek-R1 (Distilled Llama 8B) models in Listings <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> and <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>, respectively.</p>
</div>
